There are other ways to cure sickness in one turn. In
Gehennom the real danger is if you meet Demogorgon. Then you
need a 100% reliable way to cure sickness. Blessed healing,
uncursed extra healing and uncursed full healing POTIONS
will do the trick. Holy water, unless you are chaotic or
polymorphed into a demon or undead, will work. Eating a
eucalyptus leaf will cure sickness. Of course, you need to
have one (or more) of these handy.

Juiblex's sickness is very slow acting so your blessed
unicorn horn should be fine. If you get to the astral plane
and meet Pestilence, prayer is another option.
