It's certainly up to you, particularly on a first ascension.
I really don't think a careful player should ever be hit by
a (m)mf. Carry a /oFire or Lightning and scribe the E word
if cornered. Carry a /oTeleport to give the option to send
them away. An extra /oTeleport at (0:1) to be broken if a
summoning deals you an umber hulk and a (m)mf at once. A
greased helmet in case of a mistake. The jump spell along
with your speed boots will do. Just hit it with ranged
attacks until it gets close then jump away and repeat. Etc.
